## Lossy conversions (3)

- `list-products.flux.md`: pm.visualizer. Not supported by the pm shim; the call throws `Unsupported in Fluxwire` when run
- `list-products.flux.md`: require('moment'). npm packages are not available (use the built-in `Date`); import from lib/ instead
- `upload-photo.flux.md`: auth type `awsv4`. Not supported; the request inherits auth instead
